{
  "_note": "Najimi tokens, 'Your taste is the colour' (context/11-design/README.md): a neutral frame, light and dark as equals following the device, ink-filled actions, and colour only from culture: `tint` (the artwork in focus, set at runtime) and `aura-1..3` (a person's or the agent's taste colours, on orbs and washes). Legacy role names (paper, kraft, sticker, lime, signal) map into the new frame until each stage rebuilds its screens. Edit this file, then run `pnpm --filter @najimi/tokens build` (generate + WCAG gate). Never edit generated/.",
  "_roles": [
    "canvas/panel/raised",
    "line/line-strong",
    "ink/on-ink (actions)",
    "glass/glass-line (floating controls)",
    "tint (artwork colour, runtime)",
    "aura-1..3 (taste colours: orb, auras)",
    "success/warn/danger (states only)",
    "violet..butter (face disc, until S02 auras)",
    "legacy: paper/kraft/sticker/lime/signal"
  ],
  "defaultMode": "system",
